AI‑Powered Surveillance Cameras are advanced security devices that embed artificial‑intelligence or deep‑learning analytics directly into the camera hardware. By processing video streams at the edge, these cameras can classify objects, detect anomalous events, reduce false‑alarm rates, and automate large portions of video monitoring. Vendors showcase capabilities such as person and vehicle detection, intelligent inspection, queue management, and broader automated video understanding-all delivered with millisecond latency.
