What is an AI‑Powered Surveillance Camera?
An AI‑Powered Surveillance Camera is a next‑generation security device that couples high‑resolution imaging sensors with on‑device neural processors. Unlike traditional CCTV systems that merely record footage for later review, these cameras perform real‑time analytics, flagging suspicious behavior, counting people, reading license plates, and even predicting crowd dynamics. The embedded AI models are continuously updated over‑the‑air, ensuring that detection algorithms evolve alongside emerging threat patterns without the need for costly hardware replacements.
